Feature: New todo

  Background:
    Given I Visit "/"

  Scenario: Adding todos
    When I Add "buy some cheese"
    Then the Todos should Read:
      | buy some cheese |
    When I Add "feed the cat"
    Then the Todos should Read:
      | buy some cheese |
      | feed the cat |

  Scenario: The field clears once a todo is added
    When I Add "buy some cheese"
    Then the New-todo should be Empty

  Scenario: New todos go at the bottom
    When I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    And I Add "book a doctors appointment"
    Then the Todos should Read:
      | buy some cheese            |
      | feed the cat               |
      | book a doctors appointment |
    And I should See "3 items left"
    And the TestId "todo-count" should Read "3 items left"
